laska is dragged away by America. (Part Altered but completed)\n\nPart 3: The Russian Revolution is in full swing as Soviet Union feels the pressure of having to choose a side (Part Compelted)\n\nPart 4: Soviet Union is now gazing at his father as Russian Empire begged for mercy but Soviet Union shoots his father. As Soviet Union watches his father die before him, he knows he has to be strong now. (Part Compelted)\n\nPart 5: Soviet Union gazed out to a communist Russia as he smirks (Part Compeleted)\n\nPart 6:Flash forward to 1939, Third Reich looks to Soviet, pact in hand. Soviet studies the pact before shaking Third Reich's hand. (Part Compelted)\n\nPart 7: The Baltic States are annexed by the Soviet Union and then the Winter War happens against Finland (Part Taken, Completed thought not following the script)\n\nPart 8: The pact is broken between USSR and the Third Reich and Soviet shakes hands with Brtiain to indcate he is now somewhat allied with the Allies (Part Taken, Completed thought not following the script)\n\nPart 9: WW2 is coming closer to its end as the Axis is coming to their demise. The Battle of Berlin occurs  and soon West and East Germany are discovered by the Allies\n\nPart 10: West and East Germany are spilt apart by the Allies as the screen flickers back and forth between West and East Germany back against each other and the Berlin Wall dividing them (Part Completed)\n\nPart 11: America and Soviet start getting into a arguement and soon the creation of NATO is shown.\n\nPart 12:  Tensions in the Korean Pensuila intenfies as the soon North Korea is forced to sign a armistice while China and the Soviet Union are somewhat angered by this\n\nPart 13: Different scenes flashed as soon the friendship between China and USSR detoirates, USSR makes new friends with North Vietnam (modern day Vietnam) and Cuba and still shows countries with worried expressions that were a part of the Iron Curtain \n\nPart 14: Completed\n\nPart 15: Completed\n\nPart 16: the Hungarian revolution of 1956: Hungary attempts to fight the USSR, but gets stabbed in the stomach and thrown to the edge of the Duna(the largest river in Hungary)then left to bleed out (this was made by cressilia995) \n\n17: Completed\n\nPart 18: The Vitenam War is finally over (You can have like Vietnam holding his flag and happy crying or something..), but tensions are still arsing as Soviet shakes hands with someone (IDK really for this part) as a communist coup is stirring in Afghanistan\n\nPart 19: Returning our focus in the Eastern Block, we can show a worried East Germany. She (mine's a female but you can make East male if that's what you prefer) feels robbed of not being able to see her brother West in so long as her and Soviet get into a argument, causing East to eventually to go to a corner of the room,curled up and crying. \n\nPart 20: (This part is for the part for people that can do lipsync lol..) People are talking about Soviet Union behind his back and talk about how the wars have gone on long enough.. people thinking maybe communsim isn't what the country needs anymore\n\nPart 21: Tensions are rising in the Soviet Union even more as Chernobyl disaster occurs. (Please look up this event if you are not sure, I don't want to go into detail and get reported by Scratch...)\n\nPart 22: Soviet Union shows his first crack of collapse that appears on his arm after Chernobyl as you can have lipsnyc some of the lyrics if you want\n\nPart 23: Soon the Iron Curtain begins to fall as countries gain their independence and the Berlin Wall, reuniting West and East Germany\n\nPart 24:  The Soviet Republics start gaining their independence as you can flash between the different republics\n\nPart 25: Soviet Union shows more and more cracks of collapse, and you can have him lipsnyc in this part too\n\nPart 26: Last part of MAP, flashes through key highlights of  Soviet's \"life\" and at the end show him as a sprirt as he is crying happy tears or something.. IDK"}},"curre